# Environment Configuration for BudgetFriendlyAzureAdvisor

# Microsoft Foundry Configuration
# Get these values from:
# 1. Microsoft Foundry extension in VS Code, OR
# 2. Azure AI Foundry portal: https://ai.azure.com

# Your Foundry project endpoint (required)
# Example: https://your-project.api.azureml.ms
FOUNDRY_PROJECT_ENDPOINT=

# Your deployed model name (required)
# Recommended: gpt-4o, gpt-4.1, or gpt-4o-mini for cost savings
# Example: gpt-4o
FOUNDRY_MODEL_DEPLOYMENT_NAME=gpt-4o

# Note: The agent uses Azure CLI authentication (DefaultAzureCredential)
# Make sure you've run 'az login' before starting the agent
